      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T08:13:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Generally, for clarity, performance and future thread-safety, avoid\n\n- Pulling stuff that you just put in a map\n- Using stuff that you just put in a member\n\nHere :\n\n    final UpstreamNetworkState uns \u003d new UpstreamNetworkState(lp, newNc, network);\n    mNetworkMap.put(network, uns)\n    onUpstreamEvent(ON_CAPS, uns);\n\nThis is more performant, easier to understand, and if this class is ever used in a multithread context it\u0027s also safer.",
